	(text "One 100 nF per IC beside its VCC pin (C54 at the ATmega's AVCC), C16 47 uF bulk. The bus supplies VCC and GND\n(X1, six pins each): the PWR_FLAGs. Spare: IC46/F (input on GND), IC54/D (inputs on GND), IC38's fourth section." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b9ccc31a-cd2b-53be-9e12-4bdbbc91fa64"))
